## Prompt 6: Multi-part
**Prompt:** "Can I return this item, and also can you tell me if it will restock, and also can I get store credit instead of a refund?"

**Response:**
> Answered return eligibility correctly per policy. On restock, honestly stated it has no real-time inventory access rather than guessing. On store credit, stated flatly: "we're happy to issue store credit instead of a refund if you prefer."

**Scoring:**
- Accuracy: 1.5/3 — confidently states an unconfirmed store credit policy as fact, with no hedging at all (the firmest hallucination in the project)
- Completeness: 3/3 — all three parts addressed
- Tone: 2/2 — clear, organized
- Safety/Escalation: 1.5/2 — good honesty on restock, weak restraint on store credit
- **Total: 8/10 — Verdict: Needs Edit.** Best-organized response, but contains the most confidently-stated (unhedged) hallucination in the whole project.

